    <cde:designNote>Alpha modeling hypothesis for testing: biconvex and crescentic are provisionally excluded, leaving conforming and rounded as the open remainder. This division has not yet been radiologist-validated and should be reviewed clinically before being treated as authoritative. Scoped to telencephalon as a stub; deep grey, brainstem and cerebellar haemorrhages are not distinguished here.</cde:designNote>
