    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://radelement.org/ng/FindingClass"/>
    <skos:definition>A solid nodular projection from the wall of a fluid-filled structure.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel>mural nodule</skos:prefLabel>
    <cde:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-14</cde:created>
    <cde:designNote>It is a nodule, and the mural part is already carried by COMPONENT_OF: a nodule that is a component of a cyst is a mural nodule. Asking for the pre-coordinated term would duplicate what the graph already says.</cde:designNote>
    <cde:isComponent rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</cde:isComponent>
