    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://radelement.org/ng/FindingClass"/>
    <skos:definition>A break in the cortex of a rib.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel>rib fracture</skos:prefLabel>
    <cde:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-14</cde:created>
    <cde:designNote>Acuity is the question in trauma: acute, healing, healed, or of indeterminate age. Displacement and comminution matter far less. Plurality is the unhandled part: reports say 'fractures of the left fourth through seventh ribs' and the model has no way to hold a set.</cde:designNote>
    <cde:lastModified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-14</cde:lastModified>
