  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://radelement.org/ng/ExternalCarotidArteryStenosis">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>external carotid artery stenosis</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b56"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b57"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b58"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b59"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b60"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b61"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b62"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b63"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b64"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b65"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="nb9afa65a8aaa4f838d9333ccf47e4216b66"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://radelement.org/ng/FindingClass"/>
    <skos:definition>Narrowing of the external carotid artery lumen.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel>external carotid artery stenosis</skos:prefLabel>
    <cde:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-14</cde:created>
    <cde:designNote>Shares a name with internal carotid artery stenosis and almost nothing else. The internal carotid is graded on five NASCET diameter-ratio bands with two competing percentage methods; the external carotid is graded on two bands read from velocity, because the vessel is small and tortuous and a diameter ratio is unreliable there. Different element, different measurements, different modality emphasis. This demonstrates why similarly named findings must not automatically share DataElements: inserting the internal-carotid stenosis machinery here would incorrectly put NASCET percentages on this class.</cde:designNote>
    <cde:lastModified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-14</cde:lastModified>
    <cde:localId>FC-000053</cde:localId>
    <cde:nodeType>FindingClass</cde:nodeType>
    <cde:radlexCompositionBase rdf:resource="http://www.radlex.org/RID/RID5016"/>
    <cde:radlexCompositionModifier rdf:resource="http://www.radlex.org/RID/RID684"/>
    <cde:versionNumber rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</cde:versionNumber>
    <cde:versionStatus>proposed</cde:versionStatus>
  </rdf:Description>
